52:23] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-27T14:52:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T14:52:23+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177456820,"discussion_id":"6aafc2583d956717997a3f64fcee797b8d6b3d47","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了在 streamK 策略下，融合型 `add`/`mul` 操作的部分用例精度失败问题。改动位于 `FusedMatMulStreamKTiling::IsCapable()` 中，主要针对 `opType` 为 `\"add\"` 或 `\"mul\"` 的场景新增了可用性判断逻辑：当矩阵分块总数（`totalMNCnt`）超过 `aicNum / 2` 阈值时，会生成无法正确执行 `add`/`mul` 融合的 DP tile，此时返回 `false` 回退到其他 tiling 策略，确保精度。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **为 `add`/`mul` 融合操作新增 streamK 纯 SK 场景限制**：在 `FusedMatMulStreamKTiling::IsCapable()` 中，对 `opType == \"add\"` 或 `\"mul\"` 的情况，计算 `mCnt` 和 `nCnt`（基于 `BASIC_BLOCK_SIZE_256` 向上取整），当 `totalMNCnt > compileInfo_.aicNum / 2` 时返回 `false`，禁止在该场景下使用 streamK 策略，避免因 DP tile 无法正确融合而导致精度错误。\n- **注释更新**：将原有注释从 \"Only relu and \"\" and 16cast32 support streamK\" 改为 \"Only relu and \"\" and 16cast32 support streamK unconditionally\"，以区分无条件支持和有条件支持的操作类型。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-27T14:57:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T14:57:06+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177457529,"discussion_id":"79d95737c5e13601a731d75180232a1c5a6eb170","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n本次 diff 仅涉及 1 个文件：`matmul/fused_mat_mul/op_host/op_tiling/arch35/fused_matmul_basic_streamk_tiling.cpp`。变更主要为 `FusedMatMulStreamKTiling::IsCapable()` 新增了针对 `add`/`mul` 算子类型的纯 SK（StreamK）场景校验，确保不会生成无法处理融合计算的 DP tile。逻辑正确，与父类 `MatMulV3BasicStreamKTiling` 中的等价检查保持一致。\n\n**审查结果：**\n\n- **P0–P2（需修复的问题）：0 个**\n- **P3（可选改进）：1 个** — 局部 `constexpr` 声明与全局常量重复，建议移除以保持代码一致性。\n\n**整体风险：低。** 此变更为精度修复，逻辑正确，无安全性或可靠性风险。\n\n> ⚠️ 已识别出整体风险，但无法提取行内评论，请参考整体评估。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-27T14:59:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T14:59:48+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177459808,"discussion_id":"221a34295e796e39fbc4a0102cda2ac47fe2a99e","body":"/compile","created_at":"2026-06-27T15:08:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T15:08:54+08:00","user":{"id":"68ece37ba3c0221fe7971051","login":"TLE_xtx","object_id":"68ece37ba3c0221fe7971051","name":"xiaotianxiang","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/cd/ed/198c593d641784edf0deccf348085d36cfa36afc129f90a56180ae63f6175894.png?time=1766474171735","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/TLE_xtx"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177460334,"discussion_id":"f05f920bae858580762e5e3efb3fd1a04a528640","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=99b037ce58f148d0a244bf1fa01cca51&projectName=CANN'>99b037ce58f148d0a244bf1fa01cca51</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86_mobile_station</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=99b037ce58f148d0a244bf1fa01cca51&